### Test User Existence Verification Endpoint
# This endpoint should return user data if the user exists
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/verify-user-exists
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Test User Deletion
# This endpoint should delete the user and invalidate all tokens
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/user/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Protected Route After User Deletion
# This should return 401 with USER_DELETED code after user is deleted
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/user/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Refresh Token After User Deletion
# This should fail after user deletion
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}
